Let crate.annotation_select add dependencies for chosen triples

A crate can depend on another under a cfg the resolver cannot evaluate per
triple, such as a target feature that one build of a triple enables and
another does not. Taking deps among the selectable attributes lets such a
dependency be added for the triples that need it, alongside the ones
resolved from the lockfile, without adding it to every other triple.

License: Apache-2.0 (rules_rs 0.0.112)

